# Never upload these to Workers Static Assets. Wrangler deploys the files on
# disk, not what git tracks, so a gitignored file in public/ still goes live:
# macOS Finder wrote public/.DS_Store and it was served at /.DS_Store
# (2026-11-24). Same syntax as .gitignore; matches at any depth.
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
